"What’s installed, what works, and recent activity, ready to paste into a "
"report"
msgstr "已安装的内容、运行状态和最近的活动，可直接粘贴到报告中"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:97 gnome-extension/src/alerts.js:696
#: gnome-extension/src/expanded.js:216
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:98
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Back to how Isle came; your data stays"
msgstr "恢复为 Isle 的初始设置，数据会保留"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:98
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Reset all settings"
msgstr "重置所有设置"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:101
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Reset all of Isle’s settings?"
msgstr "重置 Isle 的所有设置？"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:102
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"Every option goes back to its default. Your tasks, events, clipboard history "
"and files stay."
msgstr "所有选项都将恢复默认值。你的任务、日程、剪贴板历史和文件会保留。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:103
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:120 gnome-extension/prefs.js:122
#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:1046 gnome-extension/prefs.js:1159
#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:1249 gnome-extension/src/expanded.js:46
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Weather"
msgstr "天气"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:123
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"The weather now and the week ahead, on a Weather page in the open island. "
"Read from Open-Meteo every quarter of an hour; no account, and nothing asked "
"while this is off."
msgstr ""
"当前天气和未来一周的预报，显示在展开的灵动岛的“天气”页面中。每 15 分钟从 "
"Open-Meteo 读取一次；无需账号，关闭后不会发出任何请求。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:126
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Show the weather"
msgstr "显示天气"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:126
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "The Weather page and its tab"
msgstr "“天气”页面及其标签"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:127
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Temperature beside the clock"
msgstr "在时钟旁显示温度"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:128
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "The weather’s icon and the temperature on the closed island"
msgstr "在收起的灵动岛上显示天气图标和温度"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:138 gnome-extension/prefs.js:141
#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:1046 gnome-extension/prefs.js:1161
#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:1250
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "AI Usage"
msgstr "AI 用量"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:143
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"How much of your plans' limits is used, on a Usage page in the open island, "
"with a warning as one nears its end. Found from the apps you are signed in "
"to; nothing else to set up."
msgstr ""
"在展开的灵动岛的“用量”页中查看各个套餐的额度用了多少，快用完时会提醒你。数据"
"来自你已登录的应用，无需额外设置。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:145
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Sign in to Claude Code, Codex or Grok and your plan shows up here."
msgstr "登录 Claude Code、Codex 或 Grok 后，你的套餐会显示在这里。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:147
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Show AI usage"
msgstr "显示 AI 用量"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:147
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "The Usage page and its warnings"
msgstr "“用量”页及其提醒"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:150 gnome-extension/prefs.js:151
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Share of a limit, in %"
msgstr "额度的使用比例，单位 %"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:150
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Warn at"
msgstr "提醒阈值"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:151
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Warn again at"
msgstr "再次提醒阈值"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:178
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "AI Agents"
msgstr "AI 智能体"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:179
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"Answer your coding agents from the island when they ask, and know when they "
"are done. On by default; off, Isle stops getting that agent's alerts."
msgstr ""
"在灵动岛上回应编程智能体的请求，并在它们完成时收到通知。默认开启；关闭后，"
"Isle 不再接收该智能体的提示。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:192 gnome-extension/prefs.js:1922
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Assistant"
msgstr "助手"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:195
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Voice Assistant"
msgstr "语音助手"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:196
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"Press the shortcut (or the ✦ in the open island) and speak. Speech is "
"recognised on this computer (Set up downloads it, once); the request goes to "
"the AI you pick, with your own sign-in and plan."
msgstr ""
"按下快捷键（或展开的灵动岛中的 ✦）然后说话。语音在本机识别（点“配置”后下载一"
"次）；请求会发送给你选择的 AI，使用你自己的账号和套餐。"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:200 gnome-extension/prefs.js:1169
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "AI Assistant"
msgstr "AI 助手"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:201
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "The shortcut and the ✦ in the open island. Off: Isle never asks an AI"
msgstr "快捷键和展开的灵动岛中的 ✦。关闭后，Isle 不会向任何 AI 发送请求"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:202
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Opens the assistant and listens"
msgstr "打开助手并开始聆听"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:202 gnome-extension/prefs.js:1935
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Shortcut"
msgstr "快捷键"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:209
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "AI"
msgstr "AI"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:210
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "Answers with your own sign-in; Isle runs its actions"
msgstr "使用你自己的账号回答；由 Isle 执行操作"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:211
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"Install Claude Code, Codex, Grok, opencode, Pi or Antigravity (agy), and "
"sign in"
msgstr ""
"安装 Claude Code、Codex、Grok、opencode、Pi 或 Antigravity (agy) 并登录"

