#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:340
#, no-javascript-format
msgid "About the AIs"
msgstr "关于这些 AI"

#: gnome-extension/prefs.js:341
#, no-javascript-format
msgid ""
"Claude Code and Codex answer within your Claude or ChatGPT plan's limits; "
"opencode and Pi with the providers you signed in to in them (Pi searches no "
"web). Antigravity's terms bar third-party tools from its service; Isle only "
"runs the official agy app, but use it at your own risk. Each is kept to "
"answering: commands and file changes go through Isle, which asks you first."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 和 Codex 在你的 Claude 或 ChatGPT 套餐额度内回答；opencode 和 Pi "
"使用你在其中登录的提供商（Pi 不能联网搜索）。Antigravity 的条款禁止第三方工具"
"使用其服务；Isle 只运行官方的 agy 应用，但使用风险自负。它们都只负责回答：命"
"令和文件改动都经过 Isle，并会先征得你的同意。"

